	abstract = {Nonvolatile memory devices based on a polydopamine ({PDA}) layer were fabricated by using a dip-coating process. Atomic force microscopy images revealed that the {PDA} layer had a conformal surface. The energy dispersive X-ray data showed the atomic stoichiometry of nitrogen and carbon
